{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟於11月21日發佈的Windows 11可選更新KB5132057，帶來了經過全面重構的Windows搜索功能。新搜索功能採用原生WinUI 3界面，打開速度更快，結果以單一列表呈現，並允許用户直接從搜索框調整亮度、開啓藍牙等系統設置。該功能正在Windows 11 25H2和26H2上逐步推送，若更新後仍未看到，可通過ViVeTool手動啓用。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587358.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.059661+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:31:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_hash":"2f6bf3e05ed0389728805cb8da19c47626d380f667566ca9e29bfc8ba8fa4bbf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}